---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Our Animal Welfare Plan — Simba & Good" description="How we scale our giving to animal welfare over time — from a revenue floor now toward the dream of 70% of profits." path="/welfare-plan">
  <header class="hero"><div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">Our animal welfare plan</span>
    <h1>The dream: give away 70% of our profits.</h1>
    <p>We're not going to pretend a brand-new company can give away most of its profits on day one. So here's the honest version — what we commit to now, and the future we're building toward.</p>
    <div class="honest"><b>Why "the dream," not "the promise."</b> &nbsp;Early on, profits are thin — so a share of <em>revenue</em> flows to animals from the very first month, no waiting for profitability. As we grow, the share of profits we give climbs. 70% is the destination we're building toward, in the open.</div>
  </div></header>

  <section class="plan"><div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">The path</span>
    <h2>How we get there.</h2>
    <p class="sub">Three phases, each one giving more than the last — and every step reported publicly.</p>
    <div class="stairs">
      <div class="stair">
        <span class="phase">Phase 1 · Now</span>
        <div class="big">From day one</div>
        <h3>A share of revenue</h3>
        <p>A fixed slice of everything we earn goes to animal welfare from launch — before we ever turn a profit.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="stair">
        <span class="phase">Phase 2 · Growth</span>
        <div class="big">More each year</div>
        <h3>A growing share of profit</h3>
        <p>As the business becomes sustainable, we increase what we give — and publish exactly how much.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="stair dream">
        <span class="phase">Phase 3 · The dream</span>
        <div class="big">70%</div>
        <h3>Of our profits, to animals</h3>
        <p>The destination: the large majority of what we make going straight to animals who need it.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="goes"><div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">Where it goes</span>
    <h2>Real help, for real animals.</h2>
    <div class="goes-grid">
      <div class="goes-card"><h3>Rescue &amp; rehoming</h3><p>Helping shelters get animals healthy, seen, and adopted.</p></div>
      <div class="goes-card"><h3>Veterinary care</h3><p>Treatment for animals who'd otherwise go without.</p></div>
      <div class="goes-card"><h3>Strays &amp; street animals</h3><p>Sterilisation, feeding, and care for animals with no one.</p></div>
      <div class="goes-card"><h3>Sanctuary support</h3><p>Backing the people already doing the hard work on the ground.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="trans"><div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">Our promise on this</span>
    <h2>Whatever we give, we'll show you.</h2>
    <p>Every year we'll publish what we earned, what we gave, and where it went. A giving pledge you can't check isn't a pledge — so ours will always be in the open.</p>
  </div></section>

  <section><div class="cta">
    <h2>Pick where you'd like to start.</h2>
    <p>Whether you're here for your own pet, a gift, or your business — there's a place for you.</p>
    <div class="cta-links">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/seasons">Seasons app</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost-dark" href="/shop">Shop for Good</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost-dark" href="/for-brands">For brands</a>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <style>
    .hero{padding:70px 0 20px}
    .hero .eyebrow{color:var(--gold)}
    .hero h1{font-size:clamp(38px,5.4vw,62px);margin:16px 0 20px;max-width:18ch}
    .hero p{color:var(--muted);font-size:18.5px;max-width:56ch}
    .honest{background:var(--sage);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:26px 30px;margin:34px 0 0;font-size:16px;color:var(--muted)}
    .honest b{color:var(--ink);font-family:"Fraunces",serif}
    .plan{padding:78px 0}
    .plan h2{font-size:clamp(28px,3.6vw,40px);max-width:16ch}
    .plan .sub{color:var(--muted);margin:14px 0 46px;max-width:52ch;font-size:16.5px}
    .stairs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;align-items:end}
    .stair{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:28px}
    .stair:nth-child(1){margin-top:80px}
    .stair:nth-child(2){margin-top:40px}
    .stair.dream{background:var(--forest-deep);color:#fff;border-color:var(--forest-deep);margin-top:0}
    .stair .phase{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);font-weight:600}
    .stair .big{font-family:"Fraunces",serif;font-size:34px;font-weight:600;margin:10px 0 4px}
    .stair h3{font-size:18px;margin:2px 0 10px;font-weight:500}
    .stair.dream h3{color:#fff}
    .stair p{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}
    .stair.dream p{color:#B9C6BC}
    .goes{background:var(--forest-deep);color:#fff;padding:74px 0}
    .goes .eyebrow{color:var(--gold)}
    .goes h2{color:#fff;font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,38px);max-width:16ch;margin-top:14px}
    .goes-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:44px}
    .goes-card{background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);border-radius:14px;padding:24px}
    .goes-card h3{color:#fff;font-size:17px;font-weight:500}
    .goes-card p{color:#AEBDB1;font-size:13.5px;margin-top:8px}
    .trans{padding:80px 0;text-align:center}
    .trans h2{font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,38px);max-width:20ch;margin:14px auto 0}
    .trans p{color:var(--muted);max-width:54ch;margin:18px auto 0;font-size:16.5px}
    .cta{background:var(--forest);color:#fff;border-radius:26px;padding:52px;text-align:center;margin:20px auto 80px;max-width:var(--wrap)}
    .cta h2{color:#fff;font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,40px);max-width:20ch;margin:0 auto}
    .cta p{color:#C4D2C7;margin:14px auto 28px;max-width:44ch}
    .cta .btn-primary{background:var(--gold);color:var(--forest-deep)}
    @media (max-width:860px){
      .stairs{grid-template-columns:1fr}.stair:nth-child(1),.stair:nth-child(2){margin-top:0}
      .goes-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
    }
  </style>
</Base>
